function Confectory.AlgorithmProjection::Delta (string project, string function, string implementation, string target, string options) -> string { description "Deliver revision delta replacing one bounded selection. JSON includes baseVersion, newVersion and optional options with Browse limits. Missing/mismatched baseline or retired body-scoped node IDs require full refresh. History retains the latest eight versions; no semantic tree-diff claim.";provide Confectory.AlgorithmProjection::Delta with Confectory.AlgorithmProjection::DeltaBody;}
